# Millet Jar – Farm-Fresh Millet Storefront

**Fresh from Farm to Your Family.**

Millet Jar is a modern, responsive e-commerce web application designed to bring farm-fresh millet products closer to customers through a seamless online shopping experience.

Developed by **Vask Hub**, this project focuses on creating an accessible digital storefront with product discovery, shopping cart management, customer authentication, delivery coordination, and convenient order communication.

## About the Project

Millet Jar aims to simplify the way customers discover and purchase millet-based products.

The platform provides a user-friendly shopping experience across desktop and mobile devices, allowing customers to explore products, manage their carts, review order details, and communicate their orders through WhatsApp.

The application is built with a modern web architecture, emphasizing performance, security, maintainability, and scalability.

## Key Features

### Shopping Experience
- Modern and responsive storefront.
- Product browsing and product details.
- Organized product categories.
- Smooth navigation and interactive UI.
- Mobile-first shopping experience.

### Cart Management
- Add and remove products.
- Update product quantities.
- Persistent cart using local storage.
- Server-side price verification before order processing.
- Automatic subtotal and total calculations.

### Authentication
- Google Sign-In integration.
- OAuth 2.0 with PKCE authentication flow.
- Secure session management.
- HTTP-only session cookies.

### Ordering & Delivery
- WhatsApp-based order communication.
- Product names, quantities, prices, and order totals included in order messages.
- Delivery booking workflow.
- Order confirmation experience.
- Customer account functionality.

### Security
- Environment-based configuration.
- Sensitive credentials isolated from source code.
- Server-side price validation.
- Secure authentication sessions.
- HTTP-only cookies.
- Production-ready security configurations.

## Technology Stack

| Category | Technology |
|---|---|
| Framework | Next.js 16 |
| Architecture | App Router |
| Language | TypeScript |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v4 |
| Authentication | Google OAuth 2.0 + PKCE |
| Session Management | HTTP-only Cookies |
| Cart Management | Local Storage |
| Communication | WhatsApp Integration |
| Version Control | Git & GitHub |

